520546392760"}," while using the attack action to take a -5 penalty on his attack roll and gain a +2 dodge bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
